# Window W5 of the ACPI specification (§7.4): the publication of the routes of q35's PCI interrupt pins, every root
# bridge's _PRT and the links it names read, and no _ADR, since no Device below PCI0 holds a _PRT (§3.11), on a release
# server kernel (SMOKE_TESTS=0 ./build.sh --server). The boot tells firmware the APIC model, so q35's _PRT names its
# eight GSIx links, whose _CRS and _PRS are data. Checked by tools/instructions.sh --budget
# tools/budgets/acpi-interrupt-routing.budget kernel/lpl.kernel; a change that moves the publication records the new
# counts.
